7df.mp4?t=1787371333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong> &quot;Killer Fish!!&quot;</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FISH</strong> is a Platformer Run &amp; Gun Shooter where you play as an armed FISH violently exploring through multiple levels. The game features a funny, unique stylized artstyle that could get a chuckle out of you!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312850/extras/a583a8c1292145e9a244a8cb9d9c87cf.gif?t=1787371333\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312850/extras/a583a8c1292145e9a244a8cb9d9c87cf.poster.avif?t=1787371333\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Gameplay:</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an armed <strong>FISH</strong>, your duty is to kill as many <strong>enemies</strong> and smack up that <strong>BOSS</strong>! At the end of each level you will be awarded with <strong>MONEY </strong>you can use in the next level to purchase <strong>deadly firearms!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312850/extras/a2782f6bd106014dc14b870c0b1b9af1.poster.avif?t=1787371333\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312850/extras/a2782f6bd106014dc14b870c0b1b9af1.webm?t=1787371333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312850/extras/a2782f6bd106014dc14b870c0b1b9af1.mp4?t=1787371333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312850/extras/a583a8c1292145e9a244a8cb9d9c87cf.gif?t=1787371333\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312850/extras/a583a8c1292145e9a244a8cb9d9c87cf.poster.avif?t=1787371333\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Features:</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&quot;What does this game about a peculiar little armed fish have to offer me?&quot; Well, it’s packed with some seriously awesome and rad stuff like:</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312850/extras/839e96a3724ffa73aa10e44db536e7bf.poster.avif?t=1787371333\" width=128 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312850/extras/839e96a3724ffa73aa10e44db536e7bf.webm?t=1787371333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Fish</i></strong><i> With <strong>Gun.</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Awesome <strong>Weapons.</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Weird but unique <strong>artstyle!</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fun classic <strong>Run &amp; Gun</strong> gameplay!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Terrific <strong>Bosses</strong>..</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>And more!!</i></strong><br>  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10 or 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Anything made after 2012.<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Anything made after 2010.<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any sound card that can play sounds.<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Unsupported.<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Just have a capable PC.</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10 or 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2016-Current CPUs<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2015-Current GPUs<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> A good sound card that can play sounds.<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Unsupported.<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Just have a really good PC.</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Indie","Early Access"],"developers":["dmcaguy"],"publishers":["dmcaguy"],"release_date":"Jun 22, 2026"}